        "resolution": "Fifty-four recovery-only self-transfers filled source nonces that were reserved before durable stage intent. Twenty-two higher-fee same-nonce self-transfers cancelled out-of-order signed root transactions before execution. Ordinary signed dispatches were rebroadcast unchanged. The chain reached a contiguous source nonce without changing the gateway root nonce. A consistent SQLite backup was retained, superseded history was appended, and only current cancelled root-stage pointers were cleared so the unchanged runner can rebuild designated roots in order."
